{title: 286 - Wonderful Words of Life}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #286 • WONDERFUL WORDS OF LIFE • 14.14.12.14.14}
{lyricist: PP. Bliss}
{composer: P. P. Bliss}
{key: F}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 286}
{meta: tune WONDERFUL WORDS OF LIFE}
{meta: meter 14.14.12.14.14}
{meta: category Gospel - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[F]Sing them over again to [C7]me, wonderful words of life,
[C7]Let [F]me more of their beauty see, wonderful [C7]words of life;
[C7]Words of life and beauty [F]teach me faith and duty.
[F]Beautiful words, wonderful words, wonderful words [Bb/F]of [F]life,
[C7]Beautiful words, wonderful [F]words, wonderful [C7]words of life.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: Refrain}
[C7]Beautiful [F]words, wonderful words,
[C7]wonderful words [F]of life,
[F]Beautiful [C7]words, wonderful words,
[C7]wonderful [F]words of life.
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[F]Christ, the bless'd One, [C7]gives to all
[C7]wonderful [F]words [C7]of life;
[C7]Sinner, list to [F]the loving call,
[C7]wonderful [F]words of life;
[F]All so freely given,
[C7]wooing us [F]to heaven.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[F]Sweetly echo [C7]the Gospel call,
[C7]wonderful [F]words [C7]of life;
[C7]Offer pardon [F]and peace to all,
[C7]wonderful [F]words of life;
[F]Jesus, only Savior,
[C7]sanctify [F]forever.
{end_of_verse}
